./  (the whole repository except the directories listed below)
    Origin:     protobuf-go-lite, github.com/aperturerobotics/protobuf-go-lite
                v0.19.0, tag v0.19.0, commit
                561b6c171b0f46417480998b0907b547073967a7
    Copyright:  Aperture Robotics, LLC; Christian Stewart; PlanetScale Inc.;
                The GoGo Authors; The Go Authors
    License:    BSD 3-Clause (LICENSE), with Google's patent grant (PATENTS)
    Changes:
      - The generator and the packages only it uses are moved to gen/, a
        module of their own; import paths are rewritten accordingly and to
        this fork's modules and raftseg/protobuf-go.
      - The runtime requires nothing and uses neither unsafe nor reflect:
        dependencies are copied in (below) or replaced, the unsafe
        decoding feature and DecodeStringUnsafe are removed.
      - Fixes to decoding and encoding, found by comparison with Google's
        implementation, and a limit on message nesting.
      - Deterministic generator output, and a tool that regenerates every
        generated file.
      - Repository plumbing and the TypeScript bindings were removed.
        README.md was renamed to UPSTREAM-README.md.
      FORK.md lists and explains each change.

